Settings
[code]Edit → Settings…[/code]

[ul]
[*][b]Max FPS[/b]: the frame rate cap;
[*][b]UI scale[/b]: the scale of the whole interface, applied immediately;
[*][b]Export mlog when the window loses focus[/b]: automatically export the current page to the clipboard when you switch away from the window (to another application);
[b]On by default[/b]. If the current page is not the editor, or the program is still empty, nothing happens (it will not wipe whatever else you just copied).
[/ul]

Settings live in [code]settings.json[/code] in the user directory and are only written to disk when the settings window is closed.